# WayFinder - Project Rules

## Tech Stack
- Backend: Python, FastAPI, SQLite, SQLAlchemy
- Frontend: React, Vite, Tailwind CSS

## Backend Guidelines (FastAPI)
- Use standard RESTful routing.
- Keep route handlers small; delegate business logic to separate functions.
- Always configure CORS middleware to allow frontend communication.
- Use Pydantic models for request/response validation.
- Integrate AI (OpenAI API or mock fallback) strictly in the service layer.

## Frontend Guidelines (React)
- Use functional components and React Hooks.
- Keep API calls in a separate service file (e.g., `api.js` or `services/api.js`).
- Focus on clean, intuitive UX with clear error handling.

## General
- Write clean, self-documenting code.
- Provide comments for complex AI prompt engineering logic.